# LICENSE

## Images

This dataset contains a total of 341 images distributed across the following
agricultural pest:
- Ceratitis capitata (adult)
- Dione juno (adult)
- Dione juno (larva)
- Ligyrus gibbosus (adult)
- Spodoptera frugiperda (adult)
- Spodoptera frugiperda (larva)

All images were sourced from iNaturalist and released by their authors under
the CC0 1.0 Universal (Public Domain) license. This license permits
redistribution, modification, and use without restrictions.
See: https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/deed.en

